{"parse": {"title": "山麓的回音-03", "pageid": 135154, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B1%B1%E9%BA%93%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E9%9F%B3-02\" title=\"山麓的回音-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">山麓的回音-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B1%B1%E9%BA%93%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E9%9F%B3-04\" title=\"山麓的回音-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">山麓的回音</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"\"></span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> </div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>很遗憾，关于你的疾病……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面前的医生脸上流露出为难的神色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>很熟悉的开场白，医生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我知道后面会发生什么，这种开场白往往伴随着一个不怎么好的消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>但没有关系，我已经做好了心理准备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>这种病症……极为罕见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>与这种病症相关的记录大多在“暴雨”之中遗失。即便是康复中心，如今也无法在短时间内找到治疗方法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>……我知道了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>感谢您的坦诚，医生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>不过，我还有一个问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>——我还能活多久？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>医生陷入了沉默，他似乎是在思考着如何回答塞梅尔维斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>三个月到半年不等，在此期间，你的精神与肉体都会受到病症的袭扰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我还有三个月的寿命，听上去不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>但没有人能够保证你的疾病不会提前恶化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>因此，基金会暂时停止了你的调查员工作，并安排你在康复中心进行修养诊疗，以便医疗部门随时观察你的状况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>在此期间，康复中心将会组织会诊，全力为你寻求治疗方法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>感谢您的好意。别担心，我会按照自己的步调来完成任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>不要逞强，你的身体状况并不适合继续担任调查员了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>好好休养，早日康复，才是最好的做法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我的情况确实不适合继续担任调查员的工作了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>但……假如是委外合约人才管理组织呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>你指的是历史维护小组……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>塞梅尔维斯小姐，作为一名调查员，你没有必要去担任如此危险的职务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>医生几乎是惊讶地站起身来。这个选择对于任何人来说——都是令人困惑且违反常理的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>是的，医生……但我比您更清楚委外合约小队的性质。正因为如此，它是如今最适合我的去处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>你我都很清楚，这个病症是难以治愈的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>与其将这三个月都耗费在无意义的等待之中，倒不如利用这最后的时间为基金会做出一些贡献。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>委外合约小组与调查员的性质截然不同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>我希望你不要因为一时的冲动而做出错误的决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>无非就是更危险，死亡率更高而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>对于一个寿命只剩下半年不到的人来说，这两者并无区别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我相当感谢基金会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>相较于其他神秘学家，我的血统与能力并无优势。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>但基金会依旧选择了我，而非其他更有优势的神秘学家担任调查员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我希望能够通过这种方式，回报基金会的信任。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>寂静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塞梅尔维斯与医生都陷入了寂静之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>灯光落下，沿着医生身体的轮廓勾勒出一滩朦胧的阴影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>……我明白了，你对于基金会的感情让人感到敬佩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>——你以为我会这么说吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面目和蔼的医生突然狞笑了起来，语气变得讽刺无比。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>你们这些神秘学家，总是喜欢自作聪明，结果往往是弄巧成拙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>哦，我忘记了，你甚至称不上是神秘学家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>一个无法使用神秘术的神秘学家，真的能够被称之为神秘学家吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我不知道你在说什么，医生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>能够为基金会做出贡献，是我的荣幸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>医生的面容变得扭曲，像是一道飘忽不定的鬼魂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>不管是基金会还是重塑之手，都不会在乎一个无法使用神秘术的“烂术杖”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>“烂术杖”……自从我成为调查员后，我便很少听到过这个称呼了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>真是让人怀念的称呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>哈，即便你无法使用神秘术，但那种骨子里的愚蠢，却与神秘学家如出一辙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>总是做出错误的决定，这就是你独有的天赋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>你或许会认为这是抗争，但这只是无用的挣扎罢了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>就像榕小蜂最终都会回到那个黑暗的，拥挤的无花果之中一样！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>无论你逃往何方，等待你的归宿，自始至终都是那个肮脏阴冷的角落，无用的神秘学家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>这便是你的命运，不可逆转的命运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塞梅尔维斯的表情没有发生任何的改变，仿佛面前这位可憎的医生谈论的并非自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她站起身来，朝着对方行了一礼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>时间到了，我该走了。请允许我现在离开，医生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>刹那之间，张牙舞爪的医生重归平静。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他推了推眼镜，重新坐回了桌子的后方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>你从什么时候意识到这是你的幻觉的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>从一开始。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>你应当清楚，我从来不喜欢回忆往事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>是啊……但我们终究会再见面的，塞梅尔维斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……队……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我对此早有心理准备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……队……队长！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>队长！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面前的幻影突然消失，耳旁重新萦绕起了不曾消散的歌声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我没事，埃米尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>太好了，队长！你总算有回应了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>刚刚发生了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>刚刚在战斗结束之后，你突然就愣在了原地，怎么叫你也没有反应！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>幻觉出现的越发频繁，也越发的真实，让人几乎难以分辨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>甚至，出现的不仅仅是幻觉，就连自己的记忆也有所缺失。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无论怎么回想，塞梅尔维斯也难以再度回忆起刚刚的战斗过程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这并非一个好兆头，但却在她的预期范围之内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我刚刚只是有些出神，不用担心我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>真的吗？您可千万不要有事啊，要是您有事了，我的升职可就没有希望了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>埃米尔说到一半，似乎意识到自己说错了话，他尴尬的笑了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>啊哈哈……当然队长你的状况也很重要……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>别担心，我只是在想东西，有些走神了而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>所有人注意，清理战场，寻找有用的线索，继续追查重塑之手的行踪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>是，队长！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塞梅尔维斯望向远处的雪山与落日，轻笑了一声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>原来如此，这就是所谓的“精神与肉体的袭扰”吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>真可惜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>这种程度的幻影，还不足以动摇我的意志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塞梅尔维斯转身离去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>落日的余晖洒落在她的身后，将那道飘忽不定的身影远远拉长。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "山麓的回音-03"}}